  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bilateral development cooperation within the field of peace and security</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Bilateralt utvecklingssamarbete inom fred och s&#xe4;kerhet</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FBA&#x2019;s work in the DRC during the 2015-2020 strategy period has contributed to promoting norms of gender equality among both women and men, improving accountability in the national work around the women, peace and security agenda, and increasing knowledge</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sedan juni 2015 har Sida och FBA ansvar f&#xf6;r genomf&#xf6;randet av Sveriges utvecklingssamarbete med Demokratiska republiken Kongo (DRK) 2015-2019. FBA:s insatser inom ramen f&#xf6;r strategin f&#xf6;rv&#xe4;ntas leda till st&#xe4;rkt kapacitet hos individer och institutioner att</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Folke Bernadotteakademins (FBA) uppdrag inom ramen f&#xf6;r Sveriges bilaterala f&#xf6;r utvecklingssamarbete med den Demokratista Republiken Kongo.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Folke Bernadotte Academy (FBA) contribution to Sweden&apos;s strategy on bilateral development cooperation with the Democratic Republic of Congo, with focus on peaceful and inclusive society.</narrative>
  </description>
